        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the final cost when hiring professional movers in Irvine for a 3‑bedroom house?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The total price is shaped by the volume of goods (measured in cubic feet), distance to the destination hub (approximately 850 km), special handling requirements for items like pianos or antiques, and any optional services such as packing, insurance, or storage. Packers And Movers In Irvine typically provide a transparent quote that breaks down each component, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
