      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for moving household goods from Irvine to another Indian city?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a GST‑compliant invoice, an e‑Way bill generated for the freight, a signed packing list, and a copy of the IRDAI‑approved insurance policy. If the move is for a corporate or government transfer, additional reimbursement forms may be required. Our team assists you in preparing each document to avoid delays at checkpoints.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packing system protect my belongings during a long‑distance move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, and a moisture‑resistant stretch film. It finishes with custom wooden crates for fragile items and a final outer layer of reinforced cardboard. This multi‑stage barrier absorbs shocks, buffers temperature changes, and prevents moisture ingress, keeping your goods safe throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden fees I should watch out for when hiring movers in Irvine?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transparent Packers And Movers In Irvine providers list all charges upfront: base volume rate, distance surcharge, special item fees, insurance premium, and any optional services. Hidden costs can arise from unapproved third‑party storage, last‑minute route changes, or extra labor for unlisted items. Always request a detailed, itemized quote and confirm that taxes and GST are included.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What steps should I take to prepare my home before the movers arrive in Irvine?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Begin by decluttering and donating items you no longer need. Disassemble large furniture, label all boxes by room, and protect electronics with anti‑static wrap. Ensure pathways are clear for the moving trucks and inform building management about loading dock access. Our Packers And Movers In Irvine team can provide a pre‑move checklist to streamline the process.</p>
